-- Billings now has a club with dated public sessions (five or more active rows): published with an intro.
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Billings has Montana Mahj, a mahjong house on Grand Avenue. Its beginner lessons cover a brief history of American Mahjong and each step of the game, with tiles, mats, racks and NMJL cards provided. Beyond lessons there are open play nights and weekly play sessions, and the house also has member perks, though the public sessions are open to everyone who books. If you have never played, start with a beginner lesson before an open play night.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'billings' AND "published" = 0;
